(text "12.011 V nominal; 300 mA useful shared sensor load. R64 sets approximately 0.5 A output current limit.\nMODE and DITH grounded: automatic PFM for light-load efficiency. 24.9k sets 781 kHz nominal.\nVCC supplied by the 5 V buck; EXTVCC is a LOGIC SELECT input tied low. No extra regulator.\nJoin AGND to PGND only at C68 negative pad using NT1. Keep ISP/ISN Kelvin traces separate from load copper.\nPG goes to MCU PA3 with internal pull-up. Power-good is an indication, not a calibrated rail measurement.\nVerify startup, current limiting, compensation, transients and temperature on assembled prototypes." (at 15 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7f9bc492-01b3-5957-9900-19a9e3850582"))
(embedded_fonts no))
